---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Me";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="A little introduction" title="Hello, I’m Vladislav." />
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Hey, I'm Vla. Welcome to my corner of the internet.</p>
    <p>
      I'm a full-time software engineer with a curiosity that goes well beyond
      writing code. My interests range from politics and economics to
      engineering, financial markets, and understanding how the world works.
    </p>
    <p>
      This website is my personal space on the internet — a place where I share
      a little about myself, document things I find interesting, and
      occasionally put my thoughts into words.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Do</h2>

    <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
    <p>
      I work full-time as a software engineer. Technology is a big part of my
      life, but I prefer not to limit my interests to just one field.
    </p>

    <h3>Markets &amp; Investing</h3>
    <p>
      I manage my own portfolio across stocks, indices, and cryptocurrencies.
      From time to time, I also trade using Inner Circle Trader (ICT) concepts.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm interested in how markets behave, what drives economic decisions, and
      the psychology behind price movements.
    </p>

    <h3>Manga &amp; Scanlation</h3>
    <p>
      Outside of engineering and financial markets, I contribute to MangaDex as
      a solo scanlator under an anonymous account.
    </p>
    <p>
      I mainly work on English translations, occasionally Russian ones. It's a
      creative side project that lets me contribute to the manga community.
    </p>

    <h2>A Bit About My Background</h2>
    <p>I was born in Russia, but my experience isn't limited to one country.</p>
    <p>
      Over the years, I've spent significant time living in different places,
      particularly:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Vietnam</li>
      <li>Georgia</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Living in these countries has given me firsthand experience with their
      local cultures, everyday life, and how things work beyond a tourist's
      perspective.
    </p>

    <h2>Why This Website Exists</h2>
    <p>No grand mission.</p>
    <p>
      Just a place to share who I am, what I'm working on, what I've learned,
      and whatever happens to catch my attention.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some topics might be technical. Others might involve economics, politics,
      markets, or something completely unrelated.
    </p>
    <p>I don't claim to know everything, and I don't intend to.</p>
    <p>
      <strong>I'm simply curious about how things work.</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      If something here catches your interest, feel free to stick around and
      explore.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Welcome to my little piece of the internet.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
